  "_comment": "Per-service sync config. URLs built at runtime from .env. STRATEGY (sync_strategy): 'date' (default) = chunk historical backfill on history_field and run incremental on incremental_field \u2014 use when the table has a usable date; 'full_refresh' = re-pull the WHOLE table every run and upsert \u2014 use when the table has NO timestamp and no monotonic key (reference/lines tables); see _new_table_templates below. PRIMARY KEY (primary_key) may be a single name OR a list for a composite key \u2014 lines/detail tables MUST use a composite key (e.g. [Document_No, Line_No]) because the document number repeats across line rows. incremental_is_datetime=true if incremental_field is a datetime (e.g. SystemCreatedAt). lookback_days = trailing re-scan buffer for date incremental.",
